Subject: Offer only the clipboard formats a copy holds, without the exporter's NUL

The RTF and text buffers lose the NUL IE_Exp::copyToBuffer ends them with,
so a pasted text carries no U+0000. Each copy empties the internal copy of
its selection first, and CLIPBOARD is offered in the formats that copy
holds instead of every format AbiWord reads, so a text copy offers no image
type with no data behind it.
